    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: f583c0ea009fabd47abace073f9f6cee, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 56c386941890fd04a900badb1ef15e4f, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6afdd302cc81bbe418454a48e8175521, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8538fde3ceb79d046b113af9634c14a2, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0eafa68c9fd7d064aaa62175b2fa1643, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: a48e91b429f7d0f48bef63807b016555, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9fb73be7364f04d429973e43ab4ae2cb, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 823d27e741d32c146b80f79c3b10cf8e, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: ce2736649ef49bb499253b2672aa4ea9, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9444221fc15f7354494310046d921d4a, type: 3}
  - group: {fileID: 4996366648319053103, guid: cd56ee2d263c9e64eadcc5bcb87af9e5, type: 2}
    sound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: dfc0302250851ec4f8965c58abfb3be1, type: 3}
    advanced: 0
    subtitles: 1
    text: 'Decrypt: This is a test dev commentary.'
    color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
    volume: 1
    Loop: 0
    Modular: 0
    ExtraClips: []
  - group: {fileID: 4996366648319053103, guid: cd56ee2d263c9e64eadcc5bcb87af9e5, type: 2}
    sound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4e834bf202890544ab79a67cdeff7393, type: 3}
    advanced: 0
    subtitles: 1
    text: 'Decrypt: Welcome to Fractal, it''s Decrypt. Lead developer of the game.
      These comments will help you learn the dev process behind the  game development
      and also learn some tricks of it''s design. Also to clarify, if you want to
      listen to the nodes, just interact with them the exact way you did with this
      one.'
    color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
    volume: 1
    Loop: 0
    Modular: 0
    ExtraClips: []
  - group: {fileID: 4996366648319053103, guid: cd56ee2d263c9e64eadcc5bcb87af9e5, type: 2}
    sound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3c79e8dd4384fcc45a46bcf928801949, type: 3}
    advanced: 0
    subtitles: 1
    text: 'Decrypt: This is the most hated chamber of mine. I can say that I spent
      entire 6 months in this very chamber.  Yes, this chamber was a testground for
      almost every testing element and mechanic of the game and also it is the only
      chamber that is not made of many meshes, rather one big mesh. In the beginning
      I wanted to do it that way, but decided to stick to building it in unity instead
      of blender, due to ability to edit it without changing the model in blender. 
      But yeah, this chamber brings back not the best memories.'
    color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
    volume: 1
    Loop: 0
    Modular: 0
    ExtraClips: []
  - group: {fileID: 4996366648319053103, guid: cd56ee2d263c9e64eadcc5bcb87af9e5, type: 2}
    sound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a01930d5eaa086a448dd527ba41c9953, type: 3}
    advanced: 0
    subtitles: 1
    text: 'Decrypt: In game development you usually add details only to the parts
      player can actually see.  There is no point of detailing the parts that cannot
      be seen and that would load the engine a bit more, which you dont really want. 
      And this chamber is an example of it. You see, this "behind the scenes" view
      is only detailed from the side you can actually see it, and if you look at
      the different angle, you will see that the walls are not connected at all,
      and overall its not looking good.'
    color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
    volume: 1
    Loop: 0
    Modular: 0
    ExtraClips: []
  - group: {fileID: 4996366648319053103, guid: cd56ee2d263c9e64eadcc5bcb87af9e5, type: 2}
    sound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9771a9a0763be2244806f378295ae7c3, type: 3}
    advanced: 0
    subtitles: 1
    text: 'Decrypt: And this is the first chamber to include mirrors. The fun thing
      is that reflections of these mirrors were the late addition because I felt
      that they are not really needed and would make the game laggy and unplayable,
      but they turned out really nice and I''m happy that people pointed lack of
      reflections which kind of forced me to revisit these.'
    color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
    volume: 1
    Loop: 0
    Modular: 0
    ExtraClips: []
  - group: {fileID: 4996366648319053103, guid: cd56ee2d263c9e64eadcc5bcb87af9e5, type: 2}
    sound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 53e810200f6551e4b9ae77a9e1fb22ed, type: 3}
    advanced: 1
    subtitles: 1
    text: '[Distant explosion]'
    color: {r: 0.8156863, g: 0.8980392, b: 0.7490196, a: 1}
    volume: 1
    Loop: 0
    Modular: 0
